      "n": 26,
      "kind": "content",
      "title": "Exponential Smoothening Approach",
      "text": "Exponential Smoothening Approach\nMoving average has one limitation: It gives equal importance to all observations within the window.\nBut intuitively, 2025 sales might tell us more about 2026 sales than 2023 sales.\nThat's where exponential smoothing comes in: Give more importance to recent observations and progressively less importance to older observations.",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Moving average has one limitation: It gives equal importance to all observations within the window."
